# {{name}} — Expo Mobile App

This is the **{{name}}** mobile application built with Expo and React Native.

## Structure

```
app/                   # Expo Router file-based routes
├── _layout.tsx        # Root layout with navigation
├── index.tsx          # Home screen
├── (tabs)/            # Tab-based navigation group
└── +not-found.tsx     # 404 screen
src/
├── features/          # Feature modules (self-contained)
│   └── <feature>/
│       ├── components/
│       ├── hooks/
│       ├── schemas/   # Zod validation
│       └── index.ts   # Barrel export
├── components/        # Shared components
│   └── ui/            # Reusable UI primitives
├── lib/               # Utilities and configuration
│   └── api/           # API client
└── hooks/             # Shared React hooks
```

## Rules

- Expo Router handles file-based navigation in `app/`
- Feature modules are self-contained with barrel exports
- Use `@/*` path alias for imports from `src/`
- Use `{{config.org}}/*` for shared package imports
- Max 250 lines per file
- Use `StyleSheet.create()` for styles, not inline objects
- Platform-specific code uses `.ios.tsx` / `.android.tsx` suffixes when needed
- Avoid heavy computations on the JS thread — offload to native modules
